/* R2a/R2b: the synchronization equilibrium map (ideal-current-source / classical
 * limit, Conventions-style) is the scalar  G(theta) = Vg*sin(theta) - M,  where
 * M := id_ref*wn*Lg + iq_ref*Rg  is the unbalance forcing.  Writing sin(theta)=S
 * with the circle constraint -1<=S<=1, an equilibrium S=M/Vg exists (a real theta)
 * IFF |M| <= Vg.  This certificate: if |M| < Vg (strong grid) there is a feasible
 * S=M/Vg strictly inside (-1,1); we state it division-free as M^2 < Vg^2 & Vg>0
 * -> exists S with Vg*S = M and S^2 < 1. */
